## Interface: 16001
## Title: Bobber
## Notes: Fish with the jump key. With a fishing pole in hand and standing still, it casts Fishing, then reels in the catch. Moving, swimming or in combat it jumps as usual. With Upkeep, a clickable reminder to put a lure on the pole. /bobber turns it off and on.
## Author: Martin
## Version: 1.0.2
## OptionalDeps: Upkeep
## SavedVariables: BobberDB

